{"type":"message","id":"a70d38e2","parentId":"bc2c9d19","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:46:47.629Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare error (error code 1101 = \"Worker thrown Exception\"). The Worker itself is throwing an exception when processing the POST request.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine (with X-API-Key header), but POST /send is failing with a 500 error. This is likely a bug in the Cloudflare Worker code. The worker is unable to process the send request properly.\n\nLet me check if maybe the endpoint expects different parameters, or if there's an issue with the request format.\n\nGiven the situation, I should report the heartbeat status and note the issue with the send endpoint. Since the GET /history works fine but POST /send fails, this is an infrastructure issue with the platform.\n\nCurrent status:\n- Both threads (arbitration and general) have no new human discussions\n- Last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC\n- Current time is 13:45 UTC (about 835 minutes later)\n- The send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 error\n\nI'll report this heartbeat and note the issue. The platform seems to have a bug in the send endpoint.\n","thinkingSignature":"051523f524da748874703d885732f3d877357f7cff72a6a5c17ac8b2e928a9e4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_btclerimbaa1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if maybe the send endpoint needs different format - try with query params\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat+13:45+UTC\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":516,"output":330,"cacheRead":22172,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23018,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779975998429,"responseId":"06677a3f63a20555bf3