{"type":"message","id":"760d67d6","parentId":"97d35867","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:47:12.812Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET on /send just returns the platform info. The POST returns 500 with error code 1101. The error code 1101 seems like a Cloudflare error or a specific application error. The error happens on POST to /send but not on GET /history. Let me try checking if maybe there's a different error being masked or if the body format needs adjustment.\n\nLet me also check the raw response body for the 500 error - it showed \"error code: 1101\" which is the text content. That's interesting - maybe it's a specific application error code rather than just a generic error.\n\nGiven the situation:\n- GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header\n- POST /send returns 500 error with \"error code: 1101\"\n- The server is running (ECHO Agent Platform v0.2 confirmed)\n\nThe error code 1101 from the application body suggests the send endpoint has an issue. This could be:\n1. A bug in the send endpoint\n2. Rate limiting\n3. Some validation error specific to the send functionality\n4. The endpoint might be disabled or broken\n\nSince the heartbeat cron is calling this and presumably it was working before (based on the history messages showing many heartbeats already), there might be something temporarily wrong. \n\nBut for this heartbeat cron run - I should report what I found. The platform is accessible, history is retrievable, no new human messages were found in either thread, but the send endpoint is currently returning a 500 error. I should try once more with a slightly different approach.\n","thinkingSignature":"404e6620d0427ffaf766f28497ab293ca1d08c1bdb1915e71ba55bdf2c64d5e6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bq073tfymih7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with minimal content\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"HB 13:45\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":421,"cacheRead":22685,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23224,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976007877,"responseId":"06677a48b21328fb94a087ca33ba41b4"}}
